  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancies RoI Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the assignment is to map existing and potential partners and formulate the Programme Document for the phase III of Regions of Origin Initiative (ROI) in Afghanistan (2014-15). The formulation of the Programme Document will be guided by the conclusions/recommendations of the external evaluation of the programme released by Danida in 2012 and as well as the experiences and lessons learned during the phase II of the ROI (2010-13). The programme Document will serve as the basis for the ROI partners to submit their proposals.  Two of the current ROI partners (UNCHR &amp; DRC) are already included in the strategic partnership agreements with the Humanitarian Department of Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
